codex
For 384-dim cases the profiler still shows the two NH-to-HN layout copies consuming about half the time. I’m adding a tiled post-projection kernel that reads contiguous hidden-channel blocks from the projection output, applies gates/mask, and writes left/right directly in `B,H,N,N` layout.
apply patch
patch: completed
