codex
The next bottleneck is the final LayerNorm/gate kernel: it launches one tiny program per `i,j` row and loads hidden channels with a huge stride. I’m replacing it with a tiled kernel that processes multiple rows and all 128 hidden channels at once, with coalesced loads per hidden slice.
apply patch
